{
  "fixture": "gfilter-labels",
  "version": 1,
  "encoding": {
    "input": "filter is a global filter (persisted shape: name, ty, condition, content). type_name is the field type's display name, primary_field_name the primary target's property name (absent when unknown), merged_names the names of the selected merged options (§1.9), people the display names of the selected people, active whether the filter narrows rows (computed elsewhere), date_format a dayjs / intl pattern.",
    "rule": "getGlobalFilterPillLabel: name = filter.name trimmed, else primary_field_name, else type_name. Inactive -> name. Active -> name + ': ' + summary, where the default operator of a type (text and URL contains, number equals, single select is, multi select contains, person contains, date is) is omitted and every other operator is its short word (op.*) followed by the value.",
    "values": "Select: merged_names joined with ', ', else '(n)' with n the number of ids. Person: people joined with ', ', else 'n people' / '1 person'. Date: unix seconds at 12:00 UTC formatted with date_format in local time; between joins start and end with ' – '. Relative (28/29): 'This {unit}', 'Past {unit}' / 'Next {unit}' for 1, 'Past {n} {units}' / 'Next {n} {units}' otherwise (relative-dates.json defaults). Presets 16-27: Today, Yesterday, Tomorrow, This week, Last week, Next week."
  },
